# Winlator@Frost - Production env (copy to .env.local)
# News: Supabase (as before) | Releases: S3-compatible own host (Storj 25GB free no card / Filebase 5GB free no card) OR local /supabase fallback

# Supabase (news + fallback for releases if S3 not configured) - from https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/xcahjcxoacyxouvkcvcq/settings/api
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xcahjcxoacyxouvkcvcq.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_F9ZsRgEQFH4wQTKu79RL3A_...

# Alternative persistent file host for releases (free, no card, 5GB, own bucket, not MediaFire/Drive/Mega)
# Recommended: Storj DCS (25GB free, no card, S3) https://www.storj.io/ -> Create bucket winlator-releases -> Access Keys
# Alternative: Filebase (5GB free, no card) https://filebase.com/ -> Create bucket
# Alternative: Cloudflare R2 (10GB free, needs card) -> https://dash.cloudflare.com/ -> R2 -> Create bucket
# Fill ONE set - the lib/storage-s3.ts will auto-detect via S3_* env
# Example for Storj:
# S3_ENDPOINT=https://gateway.storjshare.io
# S3_REGION=us-east-1
# S3_BUCKET=winlator-releases
# S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
# S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
# Example for Filebase:
# S3_ENDPOINT=https://s3.filebase.com
# S3_BUCKET=winlator-releases
# Example for R2:
# S3_ENDPOINT=https://<account>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
# S3_BUCKET=winlator-releases

# Optional: for bucket auto-fix API (if you want POST /api/admin/storage/fix-bucket to work without manual SQL)
# Get from Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API → service_role (keep secret, server-only)
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...

# Optional: Cloudflare Tunnel (for winlator-frost.co.th free hosting without public IP)
# Get via: cloudflared tunnel token winlator-frost
# TUNNEL_TOKEN=eyJ...

# Next.js
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=3000
